  {
   "id": "things-too-ugly-289948@major-2024-07-19",
   "gameId": "things-too-ugly-289948",
   "displayName": "\"Things Too Ugly\" Demo Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-07-19T15:15:29.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "I’m excited to share that the demo of Things Too Ugly has received an update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The demo plunges players into the night shift in a new job as they commence a thrilling sci-fi mystery,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "and it has been e x p a n d e d to provide them with a little more:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "+ Players can progress the story further",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "+ A DEMO-EXCLUSIVE EASTER EGG PUZZLE has been added",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "I want to thank all who have played the Things Too Ugly demo. It’s been a blast to watch people engage with the game’s mechanics, story, and puzzles.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you have not yet played the demo, I encourage you to take a look and kick-off the mystery within. If you have already begun the story, I invite you to return for more.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Things Too Ugly has been a labor of love, and I am so thrilled to be able to share it with you all.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy gaming!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Kevin, Professor Space Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
